# "If Great Fierce Bee dies at the same time as one or more other creatures, its ability still triggers" (the ruling), and once
# (CR 603.2c, 603.10a): Bot1's Damnation ({2}{B}{B}, paid exactly with two Mox Jets and a Mana Crypt) destroys the Bee and Bot2's Memnite
# together. Bot1 scries 1 once, bottoming its Lightning Bolt; a second scry would be asked before its next priority.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mana Crypt
Mana Crypt
Great Fierce Bee
Damnation
Plains
Lightning Bolt
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mana Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mana Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mana Crypt#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Great Fierce Bee.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mana Crypt#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Damnation.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Lightning Bolt)
! Bot1.Arrange
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Damnation; Great Fierce Bee
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
